<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak VSZ 9mo SKK 940.8 mln net profit.</title>
<headline>Slovak VSZ 9mo SKK 940.8 mln net profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine-month period ending September 30, 1996: (in billion crowns):</p>
<p> After-tax profit		0.941		1.083</p>
<p> Operating revenues	   35.876		0.201</p>
<p> Operating costs		33.693		1.665</p>
<p> Operating result		2.183	     -1.463</p>
<p> Financial revenues	    0.801		4.476</p>
<p> Financial costs		 1.323		0.534</p>
<p>Result from financial</p>
<p>  operations		    -0.522		3.943</p>
<p>Profit from regular</p>
<p>  activities		     0.946		1.083</p>
<p> Total loans		    11.467		4.182</p>
<p> Long-term loans		 7.787		3.671</p>
<p> Short-term loans		3.680		0.511</p>
<p> Reserves			  2,621		2,799</p>
<p> Basic capital		  16.449	     16,448</p>
<p> Total assets		   59.286	     45.340</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is VSZ a.s.. Results are provided by the Bratislava Stock Exchange. All figures are in positive terms except where denoted. The company is an integrated steel producer.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
